<title>GERMANY: Springer 6-mth profits rise.</title>
<headline>Springer 6-mth profits rise.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30.</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group operating profit	    229	 vs    156</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German publishing group is Axel Springer Verlag AG. The company said that first half net profits were &quot;over 100 million marks&quot; compared to 80.5 million in the same period a year earlier.</p>
</text>
